    "text": "Bay Net\nwebsite\nHughesville\nHughesville Woman Charged With DUI And Child Neglect After Driving Erratically With Toddler In Backseat\nBy BayNet Crime Desk,\n13 hours agoCALIFORNIA, Md. — Haley Dantonio, a 33-year-old woman from Hughesville, is facing criminal charges in St. Mary’s County District Court after deputies say she was driving erratically with her 5-year-old child in the backseat. The incident occurred on the evening of May 29 and has resulted in charges of child neglect and driving while impaired.\n6",
